		<title type="html"><![CDATA[New MD-2017/RT-82 Beta version 2025 01 26]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4808&amp;p=35367#p35367"><![CDATA[
<ul><li> Add APRS's Beaconing Silently flag support:  <ul>  <li> when it's enabled, the FSK tones won't be heard on the transceiver (no effect on the MD-9600/DM-1701, as they're always silent).</li>  </ul></li><li> Support manual beaconing (SK1 + 2) in all APRS modes, except for PTT mode.</li><li> Fix some display glitches when APRS beaconing is triggered while in DIGITAL mode:  <ul>  <li> Transmission state is hidden the update screen functions.</li>  </ul></li><li> Fix some last talker logics.</li><li> Fix Satellite Voice/APRS/CW Rx toggling (immediate recomputation, avoiding transmission problems).</li><li> When a beacon is transmitted, the "a" header flag is using the Counter colour.</li></ul>The firmwares are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/JMSSN3FDZC#hb62puPYtVgR" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/JMSSN3FDZC#hb62puPYtVgR</a><br>The voice prompts are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/H0XNJZFH08#YPSZxRlhHBGG" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/H0XNJZFH08#YPSZxRlhHBGG</a><br><br><strong class="text-strong">NOTE</strong>: You <span style="text-decoration:underline">need</span> to use a CPS version greater or equal the the 2025/01/26. See the CPS section <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?f=12&amp;t=4804" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?f=12&amp;t=4804</a><br><br>For translators, the on-screen texts, voice prompts CSV and CPS XML files are located at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/256SP2W1NM#mC9d2L32MEmb" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/256SP2W1NM#mC9d2L32MEmb</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sun Jan 26, 2025 9:19 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
